        "title": "A noun ending, not a free recipe",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "In these already taught nouns, the final syllable is a neutral-tone suffix. It is neither an independent head nor an animal classifier. Do not attach it freely to invent words.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这是木头，那是石头。",
                "pinyin": "zhè shì mùtou ， nà shì shítou 。",
                "meaning": "This is wood; that is stone.",
